    1728	A ⊂ F_p, not A_prime). If `g(prime) ≫ g(random)`, the gain has to
    1729	come from the HL mod-q residue distribution → links additive
    1730	combinatorics to the singular series at the *joint* level (orthogonal
    1731	to E2.13 Gowers, which is purely additive). If `g(prime) ≈ g(random)`,
    1732	this is the FIRST sum-product-class pseudorandomness measure of χ_P,
